[N 28-29 Wetlands: Menethil and Whelgar]
[D Forever Druid 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Bishop Farthing and the level-28 druid training in the Stormwind Park, then the west Wetlands: one pickup loop at Menethil Harbor, the Flying Osprey wreck, the optional croc bay and the Whelgar Excavation Site, ending at Howin Kindfeather's camp on the road junction.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 28|r  -  you are in Darkshire with every Duskwood quest handed in; hearth = Sentinel Hill and it STAYS there (chapter 22 needs it - do not set it at Menethil Harbor). This chapter is a flight to Stormwind, the druid trainer in the Park and a flight to the west Wetlands: about 17,000 quest XP on the core route, up to ~25,000 with the optional croc skins, Kristoff's errand and the group quest. You should ding 29 around Whelgar. Most Menethil quests are only |cffffcc00picked up|r here and finished on the east road in chapter 19.
[OC]|cffffcc00Carry in:|r Seeking Wisdom (269) and, if you took the detour, Return to Kristoff (346) are handed in at once; Apprentice's Duties (471) if you took it in chapter 09.

At [TAR2409 Felicia Maline], |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Stormwind]|r [G77.5,44.3 Duskwood]
[OC]|cffffffffStormwind|r  -  Cathedral Square first, then the Dwarven District, the druid trainer in the Park (west of the Trade District) and the gate ramp. Nothing here needs a fight
