[O]At [TAR1444 Brother Kristoff] in Cathedral Square, [QT346] (1,950 XP, only if you took the Northshire detour in chapter 16) - |cffffcc00Gear:|r Wandering Boots are cloth (+4 Sta +4 Int, fixed reward): wear them only if your boots are worse, else vendor [G55.0,54.2 Stormwind City]
