[O]|cffffcc00Fish to 130+ / trout stock:|r you are 28 and the Mithril Head Trout buff (+20 attack power) has been usable since 25 - if you still cannot cook it, the gap is Cooking 175, not fish. Fish off the Menethil dock (Strong Pole + Nightcrawler; [TAR3178 Stuart Fleming] at 8.0,58.4 sells crawlers and the recipe) whenever this chapter has you in the harbor, and bank the Raw Mithril Head Trout; a stack of 20 is 5 hours of buff once you can cook it [SK Fishing 130] [G8.0,58.4 Wetlands]
