[O]|cFFFF0000GROUP 3+|r At [TAR1077 Prospector Whelgar], [QA98216 Understanding Our Present] (3,150 XP) - the Goaz Stone he gives you wakes one Goaz Warder, a level 32 ELITE (new in Forever, no HP in the DB); the Titanic Keystone drops at 88%. Find a tank and a healer; you fight it in Cat Form [G38.8,52.4 Wetlands]
