[OC]|cffffcc00Check:|r the log should now hold, to finish in chapter 19: War Banners (464), From the Ashes (98221), This Land Was Their Land (98230), Crimson Crate Delivery (98240), Crocs of the Sky (98072), Fall of Dun Modr (472), In Search of The Excavation Team (306, for Tarrel) and Sida's bag (470) if you took it. Carried further: Bloom of the Heavens (98209, Auberdine), Highland Hides (98815, the Excavation Site), Gleaning Our Future (98310, Whelgar - if your group took it) and the Gnomeregan trio (2928, 98219, 538 from the Stormwind pass). Blessed Arm (322), Prehistoric Prism (98824) and For Further Study (98313) are chapter 22's pickups. Next: Howin Kindfeather and the Dragonmaw road (chapter 19)
